{
"content_id": "702274",
"reference_id": 203210,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "الثقة بالله في سفر المزامير",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "الثقة بالله في سفر المزامير",
"language": "arb",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>محبة الرب تلهم الناس ليثقوا به (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps13:5\">مزمور 13:5</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps17:7\">17:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps21:7\">21:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps32:10\">32:10</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps36:7\">36:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps52:8\">52:8</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps143:8\">143:8</a>). اسمه وسمعته يعززان الثقة أيضًا (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps9:10\">9:10</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps20:7\">20:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps33:21\">33:21</a>). يتجنب الأتقياء عبادة الآلهة المزيفة وأي شيء يضعف ثقتهم الكاملة في الرب (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps31:6\">31:6</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps31:14\">14</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps44:6\">44:6</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps49:6-Ps49:13\">49:6–13</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps52:7\">52:7</a>). الثقة في الرب تصرف حكيم. فهي ترفض ما هو غبي وشرير وتتبع طريق الرب الروحي (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps31:19\">31:19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps37:3\">37:3</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps37:5\">5</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps115:11\">115:11</a>).</p><p>بالنسبة للأتقياء، فإن كل تحدٍ في الحياة بمثابة فرصة للنمو في الثقة (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps9:9\">مزامير 9:9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps25:2\">25:2</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps46:1\">46:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps55:23\">55:23</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps57:1\">57:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps59:16\">59:16</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps62:8\">62:8</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps78:7\">78:7</a>). الأتقياء لا يخشون مواقف الحياة المختلفة (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:3-Ps56:4\">56:3–4</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:11\">11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps112:7\">112:7</a>)، بل يزدادون ثقة خلالها (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps112:7\">112:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps125:1\">125:1</a>).</p><p>يُخلص الرب الذين يثقون به ويعتني بهم ويكافئهم (انظر <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps7:1\">مزمور 7:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps16:1\">16:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps25:20\">25:20</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps26:1\">26:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps31:1-Ps31:2\">31:1–2</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps31:4\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps31:19\">19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps34:22\">34:22</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps37:39-Ps37:40\">37:39–40</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps86:2\">86:2</a>). ويباركهم الله وهم ينتظرون فداء الله (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps2:12\">2:12</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps22:4-Ps22:5\">22:4–5</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps34:8\">34:8</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps40:4\">40:4</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps84:12\">84:12</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps37:7\">37:7</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps37:34\">34</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps38:15\">38:15</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps40:1\">40:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps119:166\">119:166</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps130:5-Ps130:6\">130:5–6</a>). الإيمان بالرب يجلب الفرح ويتسبب في تمجيده (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps5:11\">5:11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps18:30-Ps18:36\">18:30–36</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps28:7\">28:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps40:3\">40:3</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:4\">56:4</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps64:10\">64:10</a>).</p><p><u>مقاطع لمزيد من الدراسة</u></p><p><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps7:1\">المزامير 7:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps9:9\">9:9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps11:1\">11:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps18:30-Ps18:36\">18:30–36</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps22:4-Ps22:5\">22:4–5</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps22:8-Ps22:9\">8–9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps25:1-Ps25:3\">25:1–3</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps25:20\">20</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps26:1\">26:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps28:7\">28:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps31:1-Ps31:6\">31:1–6</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps34:8-Ps34:10\">34:8–10</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps37:3-Ps37:9\">37:3–9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps40:1-Ps40:4\">40:1–4</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps46:1\">46:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:3-Ps56:4\">56:3–4</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps56:11\">11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps62:1-Ps62:12\">62:1–12</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps64:10\">64:10</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps78:7\">78:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps84:12\">84:12</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps86:2\">86:2</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps112:7\">112:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps115:9-Ps115:11\">115:9–11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps119:42\">119:42</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps125:1\">125:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps130:5-Ps130:6\">130:5–6</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ps141:8\">141:8</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Prov3:5\">أمثال 3:5</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Prov22:19\">22:19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa26:4\">إشعياء 26:4</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa40:31\">40:31</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer17:7\">إرميا 17:7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Heb10:35\">عبرانيين 10:35</a></p>",
